+- **Decision (2026-10-19):** redirect, not mount. Mounting `AIRail` under another url needs its detail pane to work with this page's routes; a redirect keeps one list and every old url still lands on the same rows. `TaskState --watch` keeps writing `state.jsonl`: `DashState` tails it as its pulse.
 - **Decision:** the registry has no push, so `TaskState --watch` polls it (5 s) and the file is what streams to the browser. A Servex hook that calls `TaskState.write()` on each registry change would remove the poll.
